	(descr "Zeng Yi HMS0530 moulded alloy-powder power inductor, 5.4 x 5.2 x 2.8 mm (HMS0530-2R2M, LCSC C18734448). Land pattern from the datasheet's recommended footprint: gap F 2.20, outer span G 6.00, pad height H 2.50 mm, so 1.90 x 2.50 mm pads at +/-2.05 mm. Not polarised (the dot only marks the winding start; pin 1 goes on the switch node). The 3D model is a stand-in: Coilcraft XAL5030 (5.28 x 5.48 x 3.1 mm), taller than the 2.8 mm part, so case checks against it are conservative.")
